[NAME]
npt \- NoPorts TCP tunnel client
[EXAMPLES]
.nf
npt -f @alice_client -t @alice_device -d my_server -r @rv_am -p 3389 -l 33389
.fi
[SEE ALSO]
sshnp(1), sshnpd(1), srv(1), srvd(1)
.PP
Full documentation at <https://docs.noports.com/>
